---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="overflow-hidden bg-[#0b0c10] pt-20 pb-9 text-[#f5f2ea]">
  <div class="mx-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-[1160px]">
    <section class="relative mx-auto mb-[72px] max-w-[760px] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-[#1a1c25] px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-48 -left-36 size-[420px] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,#a483ff,transparent_65%)] opacity-30 blur-[80px]"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <p class="mb-3 font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#ffc24b]">Learn in small bites</p>
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.7vw,2.5rem)] font-bold text-white">One useful word at a time.</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 mb-6 max-w-lg text-[#a7a9b6]">Start with the dictionary, follow the related concepts, and make finance make sense.</p>
        <a href="/dictionary" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[linear-gradient(100deg,#ffc24b,#ff6b5e_48%,#a483ff)] px-5 py-3 font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#1b110d] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">Start exploring <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-11 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.7fr_repeat(3,1fr)]">
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <a class="font-display text-[23px] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white" href="/">Fin<span class="bg-[linear-gradient(100deg,#ffc24b,#ff6b5e_48%,#a483ff)] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Yaar</span><i class="ml-0.5 inline-block size-[7px] -translate-y-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff6b5e]"></i></a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm text-[#a7a9b6]">The friend who finally makes money make sense. Plain-English definitions, guides, and practical finance learning.</p>
      </div>
      <div><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a7a9b6]">Dictionary</h3><div class="grid gap-2.5 text-sm"><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/dictionary">A–Z index</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/dictionary">Popular terms</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/topics">Topic hubs</a></div></div>
      <div><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a7a9b6]">Learn</h3><div class="grid gap-2.5 text-sm"><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/topics">Topics</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/courses">Courses</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/vault">AI Finance Vault</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/blog">Blog</a></div></div>
      <div><h3 class="mb-4 font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a7a9b6]">FinYaar</h3><div class="grid gap-2.5 text-sm"><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/about">About</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/contact">Contact</a><a class="text-white/80 hover:text-white" href="/about">Editorial standards</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-6 text-[13px] text-[#a7a9b6]">
      <span>&copy; {year} FinYaar. Made in India, for India.</span>
      <div class="flex gap-5"><a class="hover:text-white" href="/">Privacy</a><a class="hover:text-white" href="/">Terms</a><a class="hover:text-white" href="/">Disclaimer</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
